/ A pattern names the goals under a folder, from the folder of the goal whose step names it (as a plang path does):
/ "each goal in api/*" runs for the two goals in the api/ folder beside this one and not for the one outside it.
Start
- set %ran% = 0
- before each goal in api/*, call Count
- call api/One
- call api/Two
- call Outside
- assert %ran% equals 2, "Count ran for the two goals in api/ and not for the one outside it"

/ The goal outside the folder.
Outside
- set %done% = "yes"

/ The event's call.
Count
- add 1 to %ran%, write to %ran%
